From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stage C <stage-c@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:18:58 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] wasm: provide a process-local file-lock fallback

WASI preview 1 has no file-locking API, so `File::try_lock` reports
`ErrorKind::Unsupported` on wasm32-wasip1 and rustc's flock fallback is
`flock/unsupported.rs`, which rejects every lock. Incremental compilation
must create and lock a session directory at the start of every compile, so
it fails immediately with "file locks not supported on this platform".

Add a wasm fallback selected for `target_family = "wasm"`. It provides the
same process-local exclusive/shared registry semantics as the Unix fallback
in `flock/unix.rs`, but without the `fcntl` call, because there is no WASI
preview 1 file-lock API to call. The lock file is still opened and kept open
while the lock is held, matching the Unix fallback.

WASI preview 1 cannot coordinate locks between processes. That is acceptable
here because the stage-C host runs one rustc.wasm instance per process and
does not share an incremental directory between running compiler processes;
this limitation is documented at the top of the new module.

The unit tests cover: an exclusive lock blocks a second exclusive and a
shared lock in the same process; shared locks coexist while an exclusive
lock is blocked; and dropping the last holder releases the path for an
exclusive lock. They run on the host via `cfg(any(test, target_family =
"wasm"))` because a wasm test binary cannot run in this build.

Changed by the contributors to the rust_wasm repository.
---
 compiler/rustc_data_structures/src/flock.rs         |  10 ++++++++++
 compiler/rustc_data_structures/src/flock/wasm.rs    | 181 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 191 insertions(+)

diff --git a/compiler/rustc_data_structures/src/flock.rs b/compiler/rustc_data_structures/src/flock.rs
index deb779a..98ca8d2 100644
--- a/compiler/rustc_data_structures/src/flock.rs
+++ b/compiler/rustc_data_structures/src/flock.rs
@@ -59,7 +59,17 @@ impl Lock {
